# --- Claude Code local session state ---
/.claude/.env
/.claude/claude-docs/NEXT_SESSION_PROMPT.md
# Session-end auto-ship markers (session-end-ship.sh): the one-line commit title Claude leaves,
# the standing-blocking-questions marker that VETOES the auto-ship while it exists, and the
# anomaly report the hook leaves for the NEXT session (reseat events, timeouts, stale ship PRs).
/.claude/.ship-title
/.claude/BLOCKING_QUESTIONS.md
/.claude/SHIP_ATTENTION.md

